# Environment file for local DDEV development.
#
# Copied to `.env` on `ddev start` if `.env` does not exist yet (post-start
# hook in .ddev/config.yaml). Adjust `.env` locally; it is git-ignored.
# See `.env.dist` for the variables used on staging and production.

# TYPO3 application context
TYPO3_CONTEXT=Development
